name: embeds gvar loads

!test <drac2>
using(env="844087ed-cb06-4b66-9b36-b640519aa86f")
using(embeds=env.gvars.embeds)
return embeds.get_embed(
  desc = "Hello World!",
  title = "Title",
  footer = "Footer",
  fields = ["Field"],
  color = "#A1A1A1",
  timeout = 60,
  image = "test",
  thumb = "test"
)
</drac2>
---
description: Hello World!
title: Title
footer: Footer
field: Field
color: "#A1A1A1"
timeout: 60
image: test
thumb: test
---
name: embeds: get_embed accepts embed properties